{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203400","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203400","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1320340001:1":{"text":"ちっ、てめえらまだいやがったのか！？","source_cn":"啧，你们这群多管闲事的家伙怎么还在？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1728B2E54513BCFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320340002:1":{"text":"またあなたですか！この前もう少し待ってやるって言ったじゃないですか！","source_cn":"——又是你！上次来的时候，你不是答应我们多宽限一段时间吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E35CDE3B134D6BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320340003:1":{"text":"確かに言ったが、いつまでとは言ってねえだろ？","source_cn":"是，我是答应了，但我可没说到底要宽限多久。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6599ED099F85043","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320340004:1":{"text":"レフスキーは死んだんだろ？このままじゃエフゲルニアがいつ金を返すか分かったもんじゃねえ！","source_cn":"现在列夫斯基死了，谁知道老叶甫根尼要拖到什么时候才肯还债！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF1F474C94E7C6DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320340005:1":{"text":"か、必ず返します！明日にでも仕事を見つけて――","source_cn":"我、我不会再拖了！我明天就去找份活计挣钱——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F110DE0CBEEBEE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320340006:1":{"text":"はっ！一日二日働いたぐらいで返せる額じゃねえだろ！その間に逃げられでもしたらどうする？","source_cn":"行了！你欠了那么多钱，怎么可能一时半会就全还上！万一你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FE9B415F89D9BE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320340007:1":{"text":"だからここは手っ取り早く、この家を売って借金を返してもらおうか！","source_cn":"依我看，倒不如现在就把你赶出去，拿这房子来抵债！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FC01B7AA48EB1C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320340008:1":{"text":"なっ！そんなの、強盗と変わりないじゃないですか！","source_cn":"可恶！你简直就是强盗——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B66E269F6267817","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:讨债的商人":{"text":"借金取りの商人","source":"讨债的商人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:老叶甫根尼":{"text":"エフゲルニア","source":"老叶甫根尼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}